                        <p class="CellBody"><img class="Default" src="../images/10-40.40.030.272126.png" width="315" height="738"  alt="" title="" /></p>

          </td>
          <td style="background-color: #B2B2B2;border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 224.7262pt" colspan="2">
                        <p class="CellBodyBold"><span class="bold">A. Zone Intent and Description</span></p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 224.7262pt" colspan="2">
                        <p class="CellBody">The T1 Natural (T1) zone applies to areas of the City designated to preserve lands that do not allow significant development of any kind. It consists of lands unsuitable for settlement due to topography, hydrology or vegetation. These lands are intended to promote the management and preservation of habitat types which form a part of the unique environmental characteristics of the City and often contain trails.</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
