                        <p class="CellBody"><span class="Superscript">2</span> Sustainable features marked as &ldquo;Not Allowed&rdquo; may be approved by the Director and Stormwater Manager if it can be demonstrated that the proposed sustainable feature can be installed consistent with the intent and character of the transect zone.</p>

