          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 237.2831pt" colspan="3">
                        <p class="CellBody">3. Charter schools proposed in existing single-family residences shall be located on residential lots 1 acre or greater.</p>

          </td>
