          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 32.4939pt">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">P</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 237.2831pt" rowspan="2" colspan="3">
                        <p class="CellBody">4. A conditional use permit is required if the facility exceeds 250 seats and/or if the facility is located adjacent</p>

                        <p class="CellBody"> to a toxic use.</p>

