          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2.5pt; vertical-align: top; width: 449.344pt" colspan="8">
                        <p class="CellBody">See Chapter <a href="../Flagstaff10/Flagstaff1080000.html#10.80">10-80</a>, Definitions, for use type definitions.</p>

