                        <p class="CellBodyP2">&gt; 2,000 sf</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top" colspan="2">
                        <p class="CellBody">3 spaces/1,000 sf min. above first 2,000 sf</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
