          <td style="border-bottom: 1.0pt solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top" colspan="3">
                        <p class="CellBody">Encroachments are not allowed within a street ROW.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1.0pt solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1.0pt solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top" rowspan="2" colspan="3">
                        <p class="CellBody"><span class="Superscript">3</span> Land use types not listed above shall meet the requirements in Table <a href="../Flagstaff10/Flagstaff1050080.html#10.50.80.040">10-50.80.040</a>.A, Number of Motor Vehicle Parking Spaces Required.</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1.0pt solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top" rowspan="2" colspan="3">
